    "dateLastActivity": "2026-10-27T21:52:25.006Z",
    "desc": "## **Lore:**\n\n**“Reality is the lifeblood of entertainment.”**\n\n**The Stand of Rohan Kishibe, encountered in Hawaii. While physically weak, it posesses the terrifying ability to turn people into books. By reading them, Rohan can learn their secrets, and by writing in them, he can force them to obey absolute commands.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab5640c1d9994827fc23bc8/previews/6ab5640d1d9994827fc23bec/download/image.webp)\n\n## Pose:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ae11d072c4d1ade15db304f/previews/6ae11d072c4d1ade15db318c/download/image.webp)\n\n---\n\n## M1 Light Combo & M2 Attack\n\n![m1s.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab56d33a34be1dbae750a5e/previews/6ab56d3aa34be1dbae751242/download/m1s.gif)\n\n## Book Transmutation\n\n**Open a target’s face into a readable page.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 1s**\n\n![transmutate.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab565dfb0654cb4494c2af6/previews/6ab565e1b0654cb4494c2c57/download/transmutate.gif)\n\n‌\n\n## Written Command\n\n**Choose a command to write in the pages of someone you’ve turned into a book.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 15s**\n\n![heavens\\_door.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab565ea6f15c7cbe1623a7c/previews/6ab566146f15c7cbe1628048/download/heavens_door.gif)\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab56fceef2dc782db31e03e/previews/6ab56fceef2dc782db31e1bb/download/image.webp)\n\n## Page Rip\n\n**Grab someone you’ve turned into a book and tear out their page.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 28s**\n\n![rip.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab566a4d4308ada7da5d089/previews/6ab566abd4308ada7da5d964/download/rip.gif)\n\n## Safety Lock\n\n**Write a command that prevents the next five direct attacks from hitting you.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 55s**\n\n## Pilot Mode\n\n**Summon your stand, Then press Ctrl to enter or leave pilot.**\n\n![hvpilot.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab5680a00b961082565fce7/previews/6ab5680d00b961082566064f/download/hvpilot.gif)\n\n---\n\n# EX [Awakening Moves]\n\n## Manga [3 Bars]\n\n**Hold up Heaven’s Door’s manga panel. People nearby who look at it turn into books.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 45s**\n\n![manga.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab56731feca3f07c92c55fc/previews/6ab56735feca3f07c92c594d/download/manga.gif)\n\n## Become My Character [4 Bars]\n\n**Command someone you’ve turned into a book to fight for you with their Stand.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 120s**\n\n![character.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab568caaf8dbfe98df0ed2f/previews/6ab568ebaf8dbfe98df1215f/download/character.gif)\n\n## Chapter Counter [3 Bars]\n\n**Wait for an attack, then turn the attacker into a book.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 35s**\n\n![counter.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43569c8e358d66b0917ae/attachments/6ab568f9498d6425c3cfee0e/previews/6ab56902498d6425c3d004d8/download/counter.gif)",
